  "headline": "Paclitaxel is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21; an earlier shortage was first posted 2021-10-05 and is resolved",
  "headline_cites": ["D6"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA records show paclitaxel is not on the current shortage list as of 2026-10-21, with a prior shortage first posted 2021-10-05 now resolved.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The 6 mg/mL 50 mL vial (NDC 25021025550) used at Corvale East, Corvale General, and Corvale Lakeside is labeled by Sagent Pharmaceuticals and manufactured at the GLAND plant.",
      "cites": ["E1", "E3", "E5", "E6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer, Alembic Pharmaceuticals Limited, holds a VAI inspection classification dated 2024-03-08.",
      "cites": ["E8", "E7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East has 6 days of supply on hand for the 50 mL vial, while Corvale General has 26.1 days and Corvale Lakeside has 9.2 days.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2", "D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The top-ranked action is to transfer 29 vials of the 6 mg/mL 50 mL presentation from Corvale General to Corvale East, which would raise Corvale East to 14 days and leave Corvale General with 17 days.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A secondary option is to transfer 4 vials from Corvale General to Corvale Lakeside, bringing Corvale Lakeside to 14 days while Corvale General remains at 25 days.",
      "cites": ["D8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "A third option is to purchase from Abraxis BioScience, LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today.",
      "cites": ["D9"]
    }
  ]
}
